  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.11-local.1: Lazy-Hash Torrents - AddAsync(http(s) url) adds a PERSISTENT torrent from a web-seed URL with the infohash unknown at add (computed as it downloads), then finalizes a byte-identical infohash, caches to OPFS and restores on reload with zero re-download. Browser downloads stay zero-copy (JS.Fetch -> Uint8Array -> SubtleCrypto -> OPFS, never .NET) and coalesce per-piece GETs into ~1 MiB spans. See Plans/lazy-hash-torrents.md.",
